Welcome to Veryfi’s PHP SDK. This module provides helper functions to build AI-powered document processing tools that extract and enrich data into structured JSON—reducing manual entry, accelerating workflows, and improving accuracy.


This guide assumes you have Veryfi portal credentials (free to sign up) and basic PHP coding experience. If you’re new to Veryfi, check out our[About us page](https://www.veryfi.com/about/) .


Not sure what to build? Here are[some ideas](https://www.veryfi.com/use-cases/) to get you started solving real-world problems.


## TL;DR


- Free Signup to get API Keys:[https://app.veryfi.com/auth/register/](https://app.veryfi.com/auth/register/)
- Free SDK download from Public Repo:[https://github.com/veryfi/veryfi-php](https://github.com/veryfi/veryfi-php)
- API Docs:[https://docs.veryfi.com/](https://docs.veryfi.com/) (or use any LLM which are trained on our API doc)
- *Have fun!* Email us (support@veryfi.com) if you run into issues or[need inspiration](https://www.veryfi.com/use-cases/) .


## Installation


In your project root run


```text
composer require veryfi/veryfi-php
```


